[{"id":4270478264,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDQyNzA0NzgyNjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/events/4270478264","actor":{"login":"taljeth","id":63754730,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzU0NzMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63754730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth","html_url":"https://github.com/taljeth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-01-31T16:12:38Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"f9d0c4"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/776279553","html_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/10000#issuecomment-776279553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/10000","id":776279553,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3NjI3OTU1Mw==","user":{"login":"taljeth","id":63754730,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzU0NzMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63754730?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth","html_url":"https://github.com/taljeth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taljeth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-09T22:13:07Z","updated_at":"2021-02-09T22:13:07Z","body":"I found some time to have a closer look today.\r\n\r\nSo it seems that the proper fix would be to teach mypy to infer attributes from `__new__` (see #1021). Of course, this is somewhat out of scope for fixing the regression in #9443, and also for what I can realistically contribute.\r\n\r\nInstead, for the time being I propose to stop trying to make a clever guess if the enum class in question implements `__new__` because we just can't know what this implementation will do (if it exists, chances are that it's not the simple standard case).\r\n\r\nThe other surprising part was why the bug was only exposed on the subclass. The reason for this is that in the parent class, `__init__` declares some instance attributes, and these are considered as possible enum values. This was enough to make the bug disappear because not all of the instance attributes have the same type in the example. Of course, this behaviour is wrong and only class attributes should be considered.\r\n\r\nI'm going to prepare a PR to fix the problem along these lines.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/776279553/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"taljeth","id":63754730,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzU0NzMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63754730?v=4"